{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2023-04-12 16:30:00', 'title': 'LENNAR CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS', 'text': "MIAMI , APRIL 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LENNAR CORPORATION (NYSE: LEN AND LEN.B), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HOMEBUILDERS, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.375 PER SHARE FOR BOTH CLASS A AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON MAY 10, 2023 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 26, 2023."}